{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"第一章：基础空间分割结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spatial-hashing","title":"空间哈希与均匀网格：游戏中的 $O(1)$ 空间查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations/spatial-hashing","wordCount":1995,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"quadtree-octree","title":"四叉树与八叉树：自适应空间细分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations/quadtree-octree","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"bsp-trees","title":"BSP 树与空间二分：游戏历史中最重要的空间结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations/bsp-trees","wordCount":1767,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第一章-基础空间分割结构\">第一章：基础空间分割结构</h1><p>本章介绍三种构成游戏空间数据结构基础的经典算法：<strong>空间哈希</strong>、<strong>四叉树与八叉树</strong>、<strong>BSP 树</strong>。这三种结构代表了解决「如何把空间切割成可快速索引的块」问题的三条不同路径，理解它们的设计权衡是掌握后续高级结构的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容概览\">本章内容概览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心解决的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"spatial-hashing\">空间哈希与均匀网格</a></td>\n<td>均匀网格、多分辨率哈希</td>\n<td>大量均匀分布小对象的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"quadtree-octree\">四叉树与八叉树</a></td>\n<td>自适应树形细分、松散变体</td>\n<td>非均匀分布场景的层次化管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"bsp-trees\">BSP 树与空间二分</a></td>\n<td>编译期/运行时 BSP、CSG</td>\n<td>静态场景的精确可见性排序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"三种结构的设计哲学\">三种结构的设计哲学</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[空间划分问题] --&gt; B[均匀划分]&#10;    A --&gt; C[自适应划分]&#10;    A --&gt; D[平面二分]&#10;    B --&gt; E[空间哈希\\n固定单元格大小\\n哈希碰撞处理]&#10;    C --&gt; F[四叉树/八叉树\\n按需细分\\n深度限制]&#10;    D --&gt; G[BSP 树\\n任意平面\\n精确排序]\">graph TD\n    A[空间划分问题] --&gt; B[均匀划分]\n    A --&gt; C[自适应划分]\n    A --&gt; D[平面二分]\n    B --&gt; E[空间哈希\\n固定单元格大小\\n哈希碰撞处理]\n    C --&gt; F[四叉树/八叉树\\n按需细分\\n深度限制]\n    D --&gt; G[BSP 树\\n任意平面\\n精确排序]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"关键区别-静态-vs-动态场景\">关键区别：静态 vs 动态场景</h2><p>三种基础结构在动态更新代价上差异显著：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>空间哈希</strong>：插入/删除是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，最适合每帧大量对象移动的场景</li>\n<li><strong>四叉树/八叉树</strong>：更新代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，重平衡偶尔触发</li>\n<li><strong>BSP 树</strong>：构建代价高，几乎只用于<strong>预处理静态几何</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识回顾\">前置知识回顾</h2><p>学习本章需要理解：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>哈希函数与哈希冲突处理（开放寻址 vs 链式）</li>\n<li>递归树的遍历（深度优先、广度优先）</li>\n<li>轴对齐包围盒（AABB）的基本概念</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章为后续包围体层次（第 2 章）和查询剔除（第 3 章）奠定概念基础。</p>\n"}